#: bladecp-migrator.php includes/class-admin-page.php
msgid "BladeCP Migrator"
msgstr "BladeCP Migrator"

#: bladecp-migrator.php
msgid "Move this WordPress site to BladeCP Fast Deploy in a few clicks: check, connect, migrate, review and go live."
msgstr "Mueve este sitio WordPress a Fast Deploy de BladeCP en pocos clics: revisar, conectar, migrar, comprobar y poner en línea."

#: includes/class-admin-page.php
msgid "Migrate to BladeCP"
msgstr "Migrar a BladeCP"

#: includes/class-admin-page.php
msgid "Measuring your site files..."
msgstr "Midiendo los archivos de tu sitio..."

#. translators: 1: number of files, 2: size so far.
#: includes/class-admin-page.php
#, php-format
msgid "%1$s files, %2$s so far"
msgstr "%1$s archivos, %2$s hasta ahora"

#: includes/class-admin-page.php
msgid "Lost contact with your site. Retrying..."
msgstr "Se perdió la conexión con tu sitio. Reintentando..."

#: includes/class-admin-page.php
msgid "BladeCP can only connect to a WordPress dashboard served over HTTPS."
msgstr "BladeCP solo puede conectarse a un escritorio de WordPress servido por HTTPS."

#: includes/class-admin-page.php includes/class-connect-flow.php
#: includes/class-preflight.php
msgid "PHP has neither OpenSSL with AES-256-GCM nor sodium, so the BladeCP connection could not be stored safely. Ask your host to enable one of them."
msgstr "PHP no tiene OpenSSL con AES-256-GCM ni sodium, así que la conexión con BladeCP no podría guardarse de forma segura. Pide a tu proveedor de hosting que active uno de ellos."

#: includes/class-admin-page.php
msgid "Disconnected. The BladeCP key was removed from this site."
msgstr "Desconectado. La clave de BladeCP se eliminó de este sitio."

#: includes/class-admin-page.php
msgid "Connect to BladeCP first."
msgstr "Primero conéctate con BladeCP."

#: includes/class-admin-page.php
msgid "Fix the problems listed under \"Check your site\" first."
msgstr "Primero corrige los problemas indicados en \"Revisa tu sitio\"."

#: includes/class-admin-page.php includes/class-api-error.php
msgid "This migration no longer accepts a new package. Open it in BladeCP to see its current state."
msgstr "Esta migración ya no acepta un paquete nuevo. Ábrela en BladeCP para ver su estado actual."

#: includes/class-admin-page.php
msgid "Some site settings cannot be migrated. See \"Check your site\"."
msgstr "Algunos ajustes del sitio no se pueden migrar. Consulta \"Revisa tu sitio\"."

#: includes/class-admin-page.php
msgid "Migration started. Keep this page open for the fastest progress."
msgstr "Migración iniciada. Mantén esta página abierta para avanzar más rápido."

#: includes/class-admin-page.php
msgid "Stopped. The local package was deleted. Your BladeCP migration was not cancelled."
msgstr "Detenido. Se eliminó el paquete local. Tu migración en BladeCP no se canceló."

#: includes/class-admin-page.php
msgid "Trying again."
msgstr "Intentándolo de nuevo."

#: includes/class-admin-page.php
msgid "Enter a valid domain, for example example.com."
msgstr "Escribe un dominio válido, por ejemplo example.com."

#: includes/class-admin-page.php
msgid "Domain confirmed. BladeCP continues the migration."
msgstr "Dominio confirmado. BladeCP continúa la migración."

#: includes/class-admin-page.php
msgid "Migration approved. BladeCP is preparing your site for your domain."
msgstr "Migración aprobada. BladeCP está preparando tu sitio para tu dominio."

#: includes/class-admin-page.php
msgid "Migration cancelled. Your current site was not changed."
msgstr "Migración cancelada. Tu sitio actual no se cambió."

#: includes/class-admin-page.php
msgid "BladeCP is trying the migration again."
msgstr "BladeCP está intentando la migración de nuevo."

#: includes/class-admin-page.php
msgid "Measuring your site again."
msgstr "Midiendo tu sitio de nuevo."

#: includes/class-admin-page.php
msgid "You are not allowed to do this."
msgstr "No tienes permiso para hacer esto."

#: includes/class-admin-page.php
msgid "A custom BladeCP address is set in wp-config.php. This is meant for testing only."
msgstr "Hay una dirección personalizada de BladeCP definida en wp-config.php. Esto es solo para pruebas."

#. translators: %s: number of preflight items to fix.
#: includes/class-admin-page.php
#, php-format
msgid "%s item must be fixed"
msgid_plural "%s items must be fixed"
msgstr[0] "%s elemento debe corregirse"
msgstr[1] "%s elementos deben corregirse"

#: includes/class-admin-page.php
msgid "Check"
msgstr "Revisar"

#: includes/class-admin-page.php
msgid "Connect"
msgstr "Conectar"

#: includes/class-admin-page.php
msgid "Migrate"
msgstr "Migrar"

#: includes/class-admin-page.php
msgid "Needs your action"
msgstr "Necesita tu acción"

#: includes/class-admin-page.php
msgid "Migrator"
msgstr "Migrator"

#: includes/class-admin-page.php
msgid "Need help?"
msgstr "¿Necesitas ayuda?"

#: includes/class-admin-page.php
msgid "Connected"
msgstr "Conectado"

#: includes/class-admin-page.php
msgid "Not connected"
msgstr "No conectado"

#: includes/class-admin-page.php
msgid "Move this site to BladeCP in three steps: check, connect, migrate. Your current site keeps working until you point your domain to BladeCP."
msgstr "Mueve este sitio a BladeCP en tres pasos: revisar, conectar y migrar. Tu sitio actual sigue funcionando hasta que apuntes tu dominio a BladeCP."

#: includes/class-admin-page.php
msgid "Migration steps"
msgstr "Pasos de la migración"

#: includes/class-admin-page.php
msgid "step done"
msgstr "paso completado"

#: includes/class-admin-page.php
msgid "Fix the problems marked below before migrating."
msgstr "Corrige los problemas marcados abajo antes de migrar."

#: includes/class-admin-page.php
msgid "Everything needed for the migration is in place."
msgstr "Todo lo necesario para la migración está listo."

#: includes/class-admin-page.php
msgid "Turn on JavaScript to measure your site and follow the progress on this page."
msgstr "Activa JavaScript para medir tu sitio y seguir el progreso en esta página."

#: includes/class-admin-page.php
msgid "Check your site"
msgstr "Revisa tu sitio"

#: includes/class-admin-page.php
msgid "See the checked items"
msgstr "Ver los elementos revisados"

#: includes/class-admin-page.php
msgid "Measure again"
msgstr "Medir de nuevo"

#. translators: %s: path of a symbolic link, relative to the WordPress folder.
#: includes/class-admin-page.php
#, php-format
msgid "%s (link)"
msgstr "%s (enlace)"

#. translators: %s: path of a file or folder PHP cannot read, relative to the WordPress folder.
#: includes/class-admin-page.php
#, php-format
msgid "%s (unreadable)"
msgstr "%s (ilegible)"

#. translators: %s: number of other skipped items.
#: includes/class-admin-page.php
#, php-format
msgid "%s more"
msgid_plural "%s more"
msgstr[0] "%s más"
msgstr[1] "%s más"

#: includes/class-admin-page.php
msgid "Must be fixed"
msgstr "Debe corregirse"

#: includes/class-admin-page.php
msgid "Warning"
msgstr "Aviso"

#: includes/class-admin-page.php
msgid "Checking"
msgstr "Comprobando"

#: includes/class-admin-page.php
msgid "OK"
msgstr "Correcto"

#: includes/class-admin-page.php
msgid "Connect to BladeCP"
msgstr "Conectar con BladeCP"

#. translators: %s: date.
#: includes/class-admin-page.php
#, php-format
msgid "The connection is valid until %s."
msgstr "La conexión es válida hasta el %s."

#: includes/class-admin-page.php
msgid "This connection can only see and manage the migration you chose in BladeCP. The key is stored encrypted and never shown."
msgstr "Esta conexión solo puede ver y gestionar la migración que elegiste en BladeCP. La clave se guarda cifrada y nunca se muestra."

#: includes/class-admin-page.php
msgid "Disconnect"
msgstr "Desconectar"

#: includes/class-admin-page.php
msgid "Remove the BladeCP key from this site? A package being built here is deleted. The migration in BladeCP is not cancelled."
msgstr "¿Eliminar la clave de BladeCP de este sitio? Se borrará el paquete que se esté creando aquí. La migración en BladeCP no se cancela."

#: includes/class-admin-page.php
msgid "Connect again to continue. The package already built on this site is kept."
msgstr "Vuelve a conectarte para continuar. Se conserva el paquete ya creado en este sitio."

#: includes/class-admin-page.php
msgid "You will sign in to BladeCP, choose the server that receives this site and come back here automatically."
msgstr "Iniciarás sesión en BladeCP, elegirás el servidor que recibe este sitio y volverás aquí automáticamente."

#. translators: %s: names of the checks to fix, as shown under "Check your site" (for example "Secure connection").
#: includes/class-admin-page.php
#, php-format
msgid "To connect, first fix the item marked in red under \"Check your site\": %s."
msgid_plural "To connect, first fix the items marked in red under \"Check your site\": %s."
msgstr[0] "Para conectar, primero corrige el elemento marcado en rojo en \"Revisa tu sitio\": %s."
msgstr[1] "Para conectar, primero corrige los elementos marcados en rojo en \"Revisa tu sitio\": %s."

#. translators: %s: account email, usually masked (for example j***@example.com).
#: includes/class-admin-page.php
#, php-format
msgid "Connected to the BladeCP account %s."
msgstr "Conectado a la cuenta de BladeCP %s."

#: includes/class-admin-page.php
msgid "Connected to your BladeCP account."
msgstr "Conectado a tu cuenta de BladeCP."

#: includes/class-admin-page.php
msgid "Open this migration in BladeCP"
msgstr "Abrir esta migración en BladeCP"

#: includes/class-admin-page.php
msgid "Connect to BladeCP to continue."
msgstr "Conéctate con BladeCP para continuar."

#: includes/class-admin-page.php
msgid "Disconnect and connect again to start a new migration."
msgstr "Desconecta y vuelve a conectar para iniciar una migración nueva."

#: includes/class-admin-page.php
msgid "One click builds a package with your files and database, sends it to BladeCP and starts the migration. Large sites can take a while."
msgstr "Un clic crea un paquete con tus archivos y tu base de datos, lo envía a BladeCP e inicia la migración. Los sitios grandes pueden tardar un poco."

#: includes/class-admin-page.php
msgid "Start migration"
msgstr "Iniciar migración"

#: includes/class-admin-page.php
msgid "Migration stages"
msgstr "Etapas de la migración"

#. translators: 1: number of the current stage, 2: number of stages.
#: includes/class-admin-page.php
#, php-format
msgid "Stage %1$s of %2$s"
msgstr "Etapa %1$s de %2$s"

#: includes/class-admin-page.php
msgid "stage done"
msgstr "etapa completada"

#: includes/class-admin-page.php
msgid "Try again"
msgstr "Intentar de nuevo"

#: includes/class-admin-page.php
msgid "Delete the package built so far?"
msgstr "¿Eliminar el paquete creado hasta ahora?"

#: includes/class-admin-page.php
msgid "Start over"
msgstr "Empezar de nuevo"

#: includes/class-admin-page.php
msgid "Keep this page open for the fastest progress. If you close it, the work continues more slowly in the background."
msgstr "Mantén esta página abierta para avanzar más rápido. Si la cierras, el trabajo continúa en segundo plano, más despacio."

#: includes/class-admin-page.php
msgid "Stop"
msgstr "Detener"

#: includes/class-admin-page.php
msgid "Stop and delete the package built so far? Your BladeCP migration is not cancelled."
msgstr "¿Detener y eliminar el paquete creado hasta ahora? Tu migración en BladeCP no se cancela."

#: includes/class-admin-page.php
msgid "Details from BladeCP:"
msgstr "Detalles de BladeCP:"

#: includes/class-admin-page.php
msgid "Open the preview"
msgstr "Abrir la vista previa"

#: includes/class-admin-page.php
msgid "Approve migration"
msgstr "Aprobar migración"

#: includes/class-admin-page.php
msgid "Approve the migration? BladeCP then prepares your site to answer on your own domain."
msgstr "¿Aprobar la migración? Después BladeCP prepara tu sitio para responder en tu propio dominio."

#: includes/class-admin-page.php
msgid "Cancel migration"
msgstr "Cancelar migración"

#: includes/class-admin-page.php
msgid "Cancel this migration? Your current site is not changed."
msgstr "¿Cancelar esta migración? Tu sitio actual no cambia."

#. translators: %s: domain.
#: includes/class-admin-page.php
#, php-format
msgid "Domain confirmed: %s. Waiting for BladeCP to continue."
msgstr "Dominio confirmado: %s. Esperando a que BladeCP continúe."

#. translators: 1: number of files, 2: size, 3: PHP version.
#: includes/class-admin-page.php
#, php-format
msgid "BladeCP found %1$s files (%2$s) and PHP %3$s."
msgstr "BladeCP encontró %1$s archivos (%2$s) y PHP %3$s."

#: includes/class-admin-page.php
msgid "Domain of your site"
msgstr "Dominio de tu sitio"

#: includes/class-admin-page.php
msgid "Confirm domain"
msgstr "Confirmar dominio"

#. translators: %s: domain of the migrated site.
#: includes/class-admin-page.php
#, php-format
msgid "%s is already on your BladeCP server."
msgstr "%s ya está en tu servidor BladeCP."

#. translators: %s: domain of the migrated site.
#: includes/class-admin-page.php
#, php-format
msgid "%s already points to BladeCP."
msgstr "%s ya apunta a BladeCP."

#: includes/class-admin-page.php
msgid "Open site"
msgstr "Abrir sitio"

#: includes/class-admin-page.php
msgid "View the migrated site"
msgstr "Ver el sitio migrado"

#: includes/class-admin-page.php
msgid "Copied"
msgstr "Copiado"

#: includes/class-admin-page.php
msgid "Point the domain whenever you want"
msgstr "Cuando quieras, apunta el dominio"

#: includes/class-admin-page.php
msgid "Optional. Meanwhile, the old site stays online."
msgstr "Opcional. Mientras tanto, el sitio antiguo sigue en línea."

#: includes/class-admin-page.php
msgid "Copy both"
msgstr "Copiar los dos"

#. translators: %s: a nameserver, such as kant.ns.bladecp.com.
#: includes/class-admin-page.php
#, php-format
msgid "Copy %s"
msgstr "Copiar %s"

#: includes/class-admin-page.php
msgid "Change them at the provider where you registered the domain."
msgstr "Cámbialos en el proveedor donde registraste el dominio."

#: includes/class-admin-page.php
msgid "Change them at the provider where you registered the domain. We check on our own and let you know here when it points."
msgstr "Cámbialos en el proveedor donde registraste el dominio. Lo verificamos solos y te avisamos aquí cuando apunte."

#. translators: %s: name of the Registro.br button, "Alterar servidores DNS" (kept in Portuguese, as Registro.br shows it).
#: includes/class-admin-page.php
#, php-format
msgid ".br domain: at Registro.br, choose the domain and use %s"
msgstr "Dominio .br: en Registro.br, elige el dominio y usa %s"

#: includes/class-admin-page.php
msgid "Open Registro.br"
msgstr "Abrir Registro.br"

#: includes/class-admin-page.php
msgid "Or keep your DNS where it is and point the A record instead:"
msgstr "O mantén el DNS donde está y apunta el registro A:"

#: includes/class-admin-page.php
msgid "Type"
msgstr "Tipo"

#: includes/class-admin-page.php
msgid "Name"
msgstr "Nombre"

#: includes/class-admin-page.php
msgid "Value"
msgstr "Valor"

#: includes/class-admin-page.php
msgid "Copy"
msgstr "Copiar"

#: includes/class-admin-page.php
msgid "Optional"
msgstr "Opcional"

#: includes/class-admin-page.php
msgid "We have not detected the domain pointing to BladeCP yet, and the automatic check has ended. This does not affect the migration. If you point it later and it does not show as connected, contact support."
msgstr "Todavía no detectamos que el dominio apunte a BladeCP y la verificación automática terminó. Esto no afecta la migración. Si lo apuntas después y no aparece como conectado, contacta al soporte."

#. translators: PHP date() format for a full date, as in "October 23, 2026". Escape literal words with backslashes, as in "j \d\e F \d\e Y".
#: includes/class-admin-page.php
msgctxt "full date format"
msgid "F j, Y"
msgstr "j \\d\\e F \\d\\e Y"

#: includes/class-admin-page.php
msgid "Contact support"
msgstr "Contactar con soporte"

#: includes/class-ajax.php
msgid "Your session expired. Reload the page."
msgstr "Tu sesión caducó. Recarga la página."

#: includes/class-api-error.php
msgid "This domain is already in use in BladeCP. Choose another domain or remove the existing one in BladeCP."
msgstr "Este dominio ya está en uso en BladeCP. Elige otro dominio o elimina el existente en BladeCP."

#: includes/class-api-error.php
msgid "A different domain was already confirmed for this migration."
msgstr "Ya se confirmó un dominio diferente para esta migración."

#: includes/class-api-error.php
msgid "The domain cannot be confirmed right now. Wait a moment and try again."
msgstr "No se puede confirmar el dominio ahora. Espera un momento e inténtalo de nuevo."

#: includes/class-api-error.php
msgid "This migration cannot be retried. Connect again to start a new migration."
msgstr "Esta migración no se puede reintentar. Vuelve a conectarte para iniciar una migración nueva."

#: includes/class-api-error.php
msgid "BladeCP storage is temporarily unavailable. The plugin will try again."
msgstr "El almacenamiento de BladeCP no está disponible por ahora. El plugin lo intentará de nuevo."

#: includes/class-api-error.php
msgid "Could not reach BladeCP. Check that this site can make outgoing HTTPS connections and try again."
msgstr "No se pudo contactar con BladeCP. Comprueba que este sitio puede hacer conexiones HTTPS salientes e inténtalo de nuevo."

#: includes/class-api-error.php
msgid "The authorization expired, was already used or was cancelled. Click \"Connect to BladeCP\" to start again."
msgstr "La autorización caducó, ya se usó o se canceló. Haz clic en \"Conectar con BladeCP\" para empezar de nuevo."

#: includes/class-api-error.php
msgid "Your BladeCP connection expired or was removed. Connect to BladeCP again."
msgstr "Tu conexión con BladeCP caducó o se eliminó. Vuelve a conectarte con BladeCP."

#: includes/class-api-error.php
msgid "Migrations are not open for your BladeCP account yet. Contact BladeCP support."
msgstr "Las migraciones aún no están disponibles para tu cuenta de BladeCP. Contacta con el soporte de BladeCP."

#: includes/class-api-error.php
msgid "This connection only works for the migration chosen in BladeCP. Connect again to start another migration."
msgstr "Esta conexión solo funciona para la migración elegida en BladeCP. Vuelve a conectarte para iniciar otra migración."

#: includes/class-api-error.php
msgid "This connection is not allowed to do this. Connect to BladeCP again."
msgstr "Esta conexión no tiene permiso para esto. Vuelve a conectarte con BladeCP."

#: includes/class-api-error.php
msgid "This migration was not found in your BladeCP account. Connect again to start a new migration."
msgstr "No se encontró esta migración en tu cuenta de BladeCP. Vuelve a conectarte para iniciar una migración nueva."

#: includes/class-api-error.php
msgid "The migration changed in the meantime. The screen now shows its current state."
msgstr "La migración cambió mientras tanto. La pantalla ahora muestra su estado actual."

#: includes/class-api-error.php includes/class-migration-job.php
msgid "The site package is larger than the 50 GB limit."
msgstr "El paquete del sitio supera el límite de 50 GB."

#: includes/class-api-error.php
msgid "BladeCP received too many requests from this site. The plugin will try again in a minute."
msgstr "BladeCP recibió demasiadas solicitudes de este sitio. El plugin lo intentará de nuevo en un minuto."

#: includes/class-api-error.php
msgid "BladeCP is temporarily unavailable. The plugin will try again."
msgstr "BladeCP no está disponible por ahora. El plugin lo intentará de nuevo."

#: includes/class-api-error.php includes/class-connect-flow.php
msgid "BladeCP sent a response the plugin did not understand. Try again in a few minutes."
msgstr "BladeCP envió una respuesta que el plugin no entendió. Inténtalo de nuevo en unos minutos."

#: includes/class-api-error.php
msgid "BladeCP did not accept the request. Try again, and contact BladeCP support if it keeps happening."
msgstr "BladeCP no aceptó la solicitud. Inténtalo de nuevo y contacta con el soporte de BladeCP si sigue ocurriendo."

#. translators: %d: HTTP status code.
#: includes/class-api-error.php
#, php-format
msgid "BladeCP returned an unexpected error (HTTP %d)."
msgstr "BladeCP devolvió un error inesperado (HTTP %d)."

#: includes/class-connect-flow.php
msgid "This connection link expired or was already used. Click \"Connect to BladeCP\" again."
msgstr "Este enlace de conexión caducó o ya se usó. Haz clic en \"Conectar con BladeCP\" otra vez."

#: includes/class-connect-flow.php
msgid "BladeCP could not complete the connection. Click \"Connect to BladeCP\" to try again."
msgstr "BladeCP no pudo completar la conexión. Haz clic en \"Conectar con BladeCP\" para intentarlo de nuevo."

#: includes/class-connect-flow.php
msgid "The BladeCP connection could not be stored safely, so nothing was saved. Click \"Connect to BladeCP\" to try again."
msgstr "No se pudo guardar de forma segura la conexión con BladeCP, así que no se guardó nada. Haz clic en \"Conectar con BladeCP\" para intentarlo de nuevo."

#: includes/class-connect-flow.php
msgid "Connected to BladeCP. You can start the migration."
msgstr "Conectado con BladeCP. Ya puedes iniciar la migración."

#: includes/class-connect-flow.php
msgid "The connection was cancelled in BladeCP. Nothing was changed. Click \"Connect to BladeCP\" when you want to try again."
msgstr "La conexión se canceló en BladeCP. No se cambió nada. Haz clic en \"Conectar con BladeCP\" cuando quieras intentarlo de nuevo."

#: includes/class-connect-flow.php
msgid "This connection request expired or was cancelled in BladeCP. Click \"Connect to BladeCP\" to start again."
msgstr "Esta solicitud de conexión caducó o se canceló en BladeCP. Haz clic en \"Conectar con BladeCP\" para empezar de nuevo."

#: includes/class-connect-flow.php
msgid "Your BladeCP account has too many unfinished connections. Finish or cancel them in BladeCP, or wait a few minutes, then click \"Connect to BladeCP\" again."
msgstr "Tu cuenta de BladeCP tiene demasiadas conexiones sin terminar. Termínalas o cancélalas en BladeCP, o espera unos minutos, y haz clic en \"Conectar con BladeCP\" otra vez."

#: includes/class-job-presenter.php
msgid "Listing your site files"
msgstr "Listando los archivos de tu sitio"

#. translators: %s: number of files.
#: includes/class-job-presenter.php
#, php-format
msgid "%s files found so far"
msgstr "%s archivos encontrados hasta ahora"

#: includes/class-job-presenter.php
msgid "Exporting your database"
msgstr "Exportando tu base de datos"

#. translators: 1: tables done, 2: total tables.
#: includes/class-job-presenter.php
#, php-format
msgid "Table %1$s of %2$s"
msgstr "Tabla %1$s de %2$s"

#: includes/class-job-presenter.php
msgid "Building the package"
msgstr "Creando el paquete"

#. translators: 1: bytes packed, 2: total bytes.
#: includes/class-job-presenter.php
#, php-format
msgid "%1$s of %2$s packed"
msgstr "%1$s de %2$s empaquetados"

#: includes/class-job-presenter.php
msgid "Confirming with BladeCP"
msgstr "Confirmando con BladeCP"

#: includes/class-job-presenter.php
msgid "Sending the package to BladeCP"
msgstr "Enviando el paquete a BladeCP"

#. translators: 1: bytes sent, 2: package size.
#: includes/class-job-presenter.php
#, php-format
msgid "%1$s of %2$s sent"
msgstr "%1$s de %2$s enviados"

#: includes/class-job-presenter.php
msgid "Package sent to BladeCP"
msgstr "Paquete enviado a BladeCP"

#: includes/class-job-presenter.php
msgid "The package could not be finished"
msgstr "No se pudo terminar el paquete"

#. translators: %d: seconds.
#: includes/class-job-presenter.php
#, php-format
msgid "Trying again in %d second."
msgid_plural "Trying again in %d seconds."
msgstr[0] "Se reintentará en %d segundo."
msgstr[1] "Se reintentará en %d segundos."

#. translators: 1: free disk space, 2: space needed.
#: includes/class-migration-job.php
#, php-format
msgid "Not enough free disk space to build the package: %1$s free, about %2$s needed. Free some space or ask your host for more, then try again."
msgstr "No hay espacio libre suficiente en disco para crear el paquete: %1$s libres, unos %2$s necesarios. Libera espacio o pide más a tu proveedor de hosting e inténtalo de nuevo."

#: includes/class-migration-job.php
msgid "The local package is missing or changed. Start the migration again."
msgstr "El paquete local falta o cambió. Inicia la migración de nuevo."

#: includes/class-migration-job.php
msgid "This server cannot upload the package: the PHP cURL extension is missing and the memory limit is too low. Ask your host to enable cURL."
msgstr "Este servidor no puede enviar el paquete: falta la extensión cURL de PHP y el límite de memoria es demasiado bajo. Pide a tu proveedor de hosting que active cURL."

#: includes/class-migration-job.php
msgid "Uploading a part of the package failed. The plugin will try again."
msgstr "Falló el envío de una parte del paquete. El plugin lo intentará de nuevo."

#: includes/class-migration-job.php
msgid "The plugin cannot write to the uploads folder. Check its permissions and free space, then try again."
msgstr "El plugin no puede escribir en la carpeta de uploads. Revisa sus permisos y el espacio libre e inténtalo de nuevo."

#: includes/class-migration-job.php
msgid "Writing the package failed. The disk may be full. Free some space, then try again."
msgstr "Falló la escritura del paquete. El disco puede estar lleno. Libera espacio e inténtalo de nuevo."

#: includes/class-migration-job.php
msgid "Reading the database failed. Try again, and contact your host if it keeps happening."
msgstr "Falló la lectura de la base de datos. Inténtalo de nuevo y contacta con tu proveedor de hosting si sigue ocurriendo."

#: includes/class-migration-job.php
msgid "The database export is missing. Start the migration again."
msgstr "Falta la exportación de la base de datos. Inicia la migración de nuevo."

#: includes/class-migration-job.php
msgid "Compressing the package failed. Try again."
msgstr "Falló la compresión del paquete. Inténtalo de nuevo."

#: includes/class-migration-job.php
msgid "Something went wrong while preparing the package. Try again."
msgstr "Algo salió mal al preparar el paquete. Inténtalo de nuevo."

#: includes/class-phases.php
msgid "Waiting for your site package"
msgstr "Esperando el paquete de tu sitio"

#: includes/class-phases.php
msgid "Receiving your site package"
msgstr "Recibiendo el paquete de tu sitio"

#: includes/class-phases.php
msgid "Waiting in line"
msgstr "En la cola"

